        <ArticleTitle>White matter hyperintensities in CADASIL patients</ArticleTitle>
        <Abstract>
          <AbstractText Label="BACKGROUND">CADASIL is a hereditary cause of cerebral small vessel disease.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="METHODS">We imaged 30 patients with confirmed NOTCH3 mutations.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="RESULTS">All patients showed extensive white matter hyperintensities.</AbstractText>
        </Abstract>
